,"manufacturer":"Honda (American Honda Motor Co.)","component":"AIR BAGS:FRONTAL:PASSENGER SIDE:INFLATOR MODULE","summary":"Honda (American Honda Motor Co.) is recalling certain 2014 Honda Insight and Acura TSX and TSX Wagon, 2014-2015 Honda Crosstour and Pilot vehicles nationwide, as well as certain 2014 Honda FCX Clarity and Fit EV vehicles in Florida, Hawaii, Puerto Rico, Texas, Alabama, Georgia, Louisiana, Mississippi, South Carolina, California, American Samoa, Guam, the Northern Mariana Islands (Saipan) and the U.S. Virgin Islands.\r\n\r\nHonda is also recalling certain 2011-2013 Acura TSX, TSX Wagon and ZDX, Honda Crosstour, Insight, Fit and Pilot vehicles, 2011-2012 Honda Accord and 2011 Honda Civic NGV, Civic, Civic Hybrid and CR-V vehicles in Arizona, Arkansas, Delaware, the District of Columbia, Illinois, Indiana, Kansas, Kentucky, Maryland, Missouri, Nebraska, Nevada, New Jersey, New Mexico, North Carolina, Ohio, Oklahoma, Pennsylvania, Tennessee, Virginia and West Virginia.\r\n\r\nLastly, Honda is recalling certain 2010-2013 Acura TSX and ZDX, Honda Crosstour, Fit, Insight and Pilot, 2011-2013 TSX Wagon, 2010-2012 Honda Accord and 2010-2011 Honda Civic NGV, Civic, Civic Hybrid and CR-V vehicles in Alaska, Colorado, Connecticut, Idaho, Iowa, Maine, Massachusetts, Michigan, Minnesota, Montana, New Hampshire, New York, North Dakota, Oregon, Rhode Island, South Dakota, Utah, Vermont, Washington, Wisconsin and Wyoming.\r\n\r\nThese vehicles are equipped with certain air bag air bag inflators assembled as part of the frontal air bag modules, and used as original equipment or replacement equipment (such as after a vehicle crash necessitating replacement of the original air bags), may explode due to propellant degradation occurring after long-term exposure to higher absolute humidity, temperature and temperature cycling.","consequence":"An inflator explosion may result in sharp metal fragments striking the driver or other occupants resulting in serious injury or death.","remedy":"Honda will notify owners, and dealers will replace the passenger frontal air bag inflator, free of charge. The recall began November 6, 2018.  Owners may contact Honda customer service at 1-888-234-2138.  Honda's numbers for this recall are M2J and S2K.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":1355406,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=18V661000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":41,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"ACCORD"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"INSIGHT"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2010","make":"ACURA","model":"TSX"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"CR-V"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"FIT"},{"year":"2011","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2010","make":"ACURA","model":"ZDX"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"CROSSTOUR"},{"year":"2013","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2010","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC HYBRID"},{"year":"2012","make":"ACURA","model":"TSX"},{"year":"2012","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2011","make":"HONDA","model":"INSIGHT"},{"year":"2012","make":"HONDA","model":"FIT"},{"year":"2011","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC"},{"year":"2013","make":"HONDA","model":"CROSSTOUR"},{"year":"2012","make":"HONDA","model":"ACCORD"},{"year":"2012","make":"HONDA","model":"INSIGHT"},{"year":"2011","make":"HONDA","model":"CR-V"},{"year":"2011","make":"ACURA","model":"ZDX"},{"year":"2012","make":"ACURA","model":"ZDX"},{"year":"2013","make":"HONDA","model":"FIT"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":true},{"campaign":"18V268000","received":"2018-04-26","manufacturer":"Honda (American Honda Motor Co.)","component":"AIR BAGS:FRONTAL:PASSENGER SIDE:INFLATOR MODULE","summary":"Honda (American Honda Motor Co.) is recalling certain 2003-2012 Honda Accord and Pilot, 2010 Accord Crosstour, 2001-2011 Civic, 2002-2011 CR-V, 2003-2004, 2006-2008 and 2011 Element, 2007 and 2009-2013 Fit, 2010-2012 Insight, 2002-2004 Odyssey, and 2012 Ridgeline vehicles.  The front passenger air bag may have been installed incorrectly during replacement.","consequence":"An incorrectly installed air bag may deploy improperly in the event of a crash, increasing the risk of injury.","remedy":"Honda will notify owners, and dealers will inspect and, if necessary, replace the passenger frontal air bag module assembly, free of charge.  The recall began June 22, 2018.  Owners may contact Honda customer service at 1-888-234-2138.  Honda's numbers for this recall are K1P, and M1O.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":1335,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=18V268000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":61,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2005","make":"HONDA","model":"ACCORD"},{"year":"2004","make":"HONDA","model":"ACCORD"},{"year":"2003","make":"HONDA","model":"ACCORD"},{"year":"2004","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC"},{"year":"2003","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC"},{"year":"2002","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC"},{"year":"2001","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC"},{"year":"2004","make":"HONDA","model":"CR-V"},{"year":"2003","make":"HONDA","model":"CR-V"},{"year":"2002","make":"HONDA","model":"CR-V"},{"year":"2004","make":"HONDA","model":"ELEMENT"},{"year":"2003","make":"HONDA","model":"ELEMENT"},{"year":"2004","make":"HONDA","model":"ODYSSEY"},{"year":"2003","make":"HONDA","model":"ODYSSEY"},{"year":"2002","make":"HONDA","model":"ODYSSEY"},{"year":"2004","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2003","make":"HONDA","model":"PILOT"},{"year":"2005","make":"HONDA","model":"CIVIC"},{"year":"2006","make":"HONDA","model":"ELEMENT"},{"year":"2006","make":"HONDA","model":"